// ccpa — California Consumer Privacy Act, as amended by the CPRA
//
// The law: the CCPA does not restrict where personal information is
// stored. Businesses must implement reasonable security (Cal. Civ. Code
// §1798.100(e)) and bind service providers by contract (§1798.140(ag)).
//
// This pack: offers must have a contract and an audit (T2 or better).
//
// Use `import "ccpa"`. Not legal advice.

policy ccpa {
  min_trust = T2
}
